<title>SWITZERLAND: Von Roll acquires Thyssen unit.</title>
<headline>Von Roll acquires Thyssen unit.</headline>
<dateline>GERLAFINGEN, Switzerland 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss steel and engineering group Von Roll AG said it acquired Ferrozell GmbH, a maker of fibre bundling materials, from German steel group Thyssen AG.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal, which is subject to German cartel office approval, were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Ferrozell had 1995 turnover of 75 million marks. Based in Augsburg, Germany, it employs 300 workers.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
